<title>ETHIOPIA: Ethiopia names new agriculture minister.</title>
<headline>Ethiopia names new agriculture minister.</headline>
<dateline>ADDIS ABABA 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ethiopia has appointed Seifu Ketema as agriculture minister, the Ethiopian News Agency said on Friday.</p>
<p>The agency quoted Prime Minister Meles Zenawi as thanking outgoing minister Teketel Forsido, but saying his &quot;ability was not commensurate with the ever-expanding demands of the job&quot;.</p>
</text>
